    schema:description "The Instituto Casa do Choro, installed at Rua da Carioca, 38 - Centro, Rio de Janeiro, in a building protected by INEPAC, built around 1902 and ceded by the Government of the State of Rio de Janeiro. It keeps the digitised collection of scores published in this dataset and is responsible for the editions that bear its name. Contact: +55 21 2242-9947 / contato@casadochoro.com.br".
